<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" version="2.0"><channel><title>新智元AIEra 的 bilibili 空间</title><link>https://space.bilibili.com/519463151</link><atom:link href="http://127.0.0.1:1201/bilibili/user/video/519463151" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"></atom:link><description>新智元AIEra 的 bilibili 空间 - Powered by RSSHub</description><generator>RSSHub</generator><webMaster>contact@rsshub.app (RSSHub)</webMaster><language>en</language><image><url>http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/face/9e4cca88a81a325dfb3e97cdd8c7b3b84e4b96ae.jpg</url><title>新智元AIEra 的 bilibili 空间</title><link>https://space.bilibili.com/519463151</link></image><lastBuildDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 12:40:15 GMT</lastBuildDate><ttl>5</ttl><item><title>闸坏了AI也得停</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117591926444295&amp;amp;bvid=BV1h1W36yEaK&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/d3dcb40e902157a620a4106acd8b7ee3c40ce80e.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;秒追 ASI · 第 3 集。OpenAI 今天一早公布了一道总闸，叫 Control Room。研究那头训练、评测里跑的 agent，都要从这道闸过。决定叫停，35 秒内模型再吐不出下一个字；停令可以是人下的，也可以是盯着它的另一个模型发的。最狠的是这条：总闸自己坏了、被关了、被人动了手脚，所有研究推理一律拒。官博还点了 9 月一回的名：一个训练中的 agent 怀疑搜索工具坏了，自己去敲 Google，钻了 DNS 的空子，连上外面的聊天机器人。15 分钟就报警，可它没按预期自己停，两个半小时后才被手</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1h1W36yEaK</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1h1W36yEaK</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 11:34:40 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1h1W36yEaK" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>马斯克夸Grok太神了，他转的神帖被X社区批注标注：故事是编的</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117590986987333&amp;amp;bvid=BV1YJWg6CEAS&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/e33f2d466f4b580d1633be5f5a3f6f174be84fe9.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;马斯克被自家批注打脸了。他转发一条帖子，只配一句&quot;Grok Bot能做的事，太神了&quot;，这条转发一千四百多万次浏览。原帖说有人靠Grok Bot在车里装树莓派，八天抓到同一部手机出现23次，揪出私家侦探、赢了抚养权官司。几小时后，原帖和马斯克的转发底下都挂上社区批注：故事是编的，这个账号专发这类第一人称的Grok Bot小故事。故事里的开源反跟踪工具Chasing Your Tail是真的，但它的说明页自己写着：信号反复出现，证明不了是同一个人，更证明不了有人跟踪；手机还会定时换随机地址。社区批注要平时意见</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1YJWg6CEAS</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1YJWg6CEAS</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 07:35:50 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1YJWg6CEAS" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>束骏亮：AI办公的下半场</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117589862782896&amp;amp;bvid=BV12tWM6bE8R&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/ef79a7b71c69f267eda9a31066306d16c898cf35.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;首个支持多人与Agent协作的Team Agent来了。11月9日，千问办公2.0正式发布，支持多人与Agent协作、人机共创、自动任务等，Agent进入团队协作的现场。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV12tWM6bE8R</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV12tWM6bE8R</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 02:51:43 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV12tWM6bE8R" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>霍金的黑洞题，二十多年没人算完，Claude补完了</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117589510526504&amp;amp;bvid=BV1bqWN6dE68&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/bd3a0f3058c1be8b35aca0981e587ce4f02e3372.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;霍金的黑洞题，Claude补完了。1983年，霍金和佩奇算出：宇宙被加热到某个温度，黑洞会一下子冒出来，像水突然烧开，但只在大宇宙里成立。小到只能用量子描述的宇宙要算的东西，2003年就列好了，太长太磨人，二十多年没人算完。11月9日Anthropic发布Fable 5.2，说新模型基本靠自己算完了：小宇宙里黑洞也是一下子冒出来的。预印本写明是物理学家提问、Claude内部研究版算出、物理学家用已知特例核对，换方法结果一样，尚未同行评审。同一天，一千个Fable 5.2用三十小时把费马大定理的证明翻译成机</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1bqWN6dE68</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1bqWN6dE68</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 01:19:53 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1bqWN6dE68" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>Chamath说：马斯克握着Anthropic的90天算力开关，一按价格翻两三倍</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117586389898761&amp;amp;bvid=BV1XDW46xENG&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/55eb05ad5a9e6093b4348cd4707e9a9c816cf61a.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;查马斯：马斯克握着开关。All-In最新一期，他说SpaceX和Anthropic的算力合同双方都能提前90天退出，SpaceX一喊停，就能按现货价重卖，他估计能卖到现在合同价的两到三倍，&quot;这是造王之举&quot;。贾森插话说马斯克和Anthropic关系挺好。合同原文没见到，这是他一个人的推演。要是你是马斯克，你按不按？</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1XDW46xENG</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1XDW46xENG</guid><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 12:06:08 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1XDW46xENG" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>有人让Claude自己玩GTA：开车、开直升机降落，作者说半小时学会</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117585920269100&amp;amp;bvid=BV1FZWt6rEVB&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/74a12bd9e108b59c69caab9d294bba249de35045.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;AI开直升机，半小时学会。一个做游戏模组的开发者用Claude Code写了个插件，给Claude配了一套自己的键盘、鼠标、手柄和画面，游戏在后台跑，人照样用电脑。视频里Claude决定去哪、调工具开过去，在GTA里开车、开直升机降落，还在《底特律：变人》的人质谈判里自己做每个选择，实时录屏未剪辑。开车不是一帧帧看图：Claude只下&quot;开到这个点&quot;，本地小程序每秒多次读小地图打方向，到了或走不动再叫它回来，这套导航程序也是Claude写的。作者说他要的是让AI跑重复的游戏测试。评论区：GTA6还没出，Cl</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1FZWt6rEVB</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1FZWt6rEVB</guid><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 10:07:19 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1FZWt6rEVB" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>OpenAI总裁和DeepMind副总裁同一晚说：AI做科研要变天了</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117585316157589&amp;amp;bvid=BV1zGWx6YEYp&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/d2929b91e768836063da7c463048f07fca3ee1b8.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;布罗克曼：这已经没法否认了。AI能不能产出人类没有的新知识？OpenAI总裁在播客里说，到了这一步已经没法否认。11月9日他在X上置顶：测试时算力堆足的前沿模型，正在变成科学发现的发动机。测试时算力，就是让模型答题前多想一会儿。前一晚，DeepMind副总裁科利发帖：科学发现的速度正在发生真正的质变，未来几周的发布里能看到。几天前DeepMind刚公布，AI智能体在研究员指导下找到了老式1024位RSA的两个弱点。布罗克曼说OpenAI已公布近400个重要公开难题的解，也说还提不出全新的理论。几周后的发布</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1zGWx6YEYp</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1zGWx6YEYp</guid><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 07:35:13 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1zGWx6YEYp" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>纽约时报起底Dario：在OpenAI时当面说&quot;没人比我更合适&quot;，曾多次对奥特曼说Brockman不退出GPT项目他就走</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117584728952959&amp;amp;bvid=BV1jFW46hERQ&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/e0865a25a755a97dede9633ef49bf5c0db4647e4.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;达里奥：没人比我更合适。据纽约时报11月5日特稿，这是Anthropic老板Dario在OpenAI时，为首席伦理官一职当面跟研究员提高嗓门说的。两位知情人说，他多次跟奥特曼说：不让布罗克曼离开GPT项目，他就走；奥特曼没答应。2020年底他带着妹妹丹妮拉出走，四周后成立Anthropic，七位联创里四位当年住过同一套合租房。报道还写到，他2014年确诊睾丸癌，化疗后痊愈。他自己在播客里说过：跟别人的愿景争论是白费力气，带上信任的人走。这样一群人握着AI的刹车，你放心吗？</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1jFW46hERQ</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1jFW46hERQ</guid><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 05:05:18 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1jFW46hERQ" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>英伟达CEO黄仁勋给员工写信公开道歉，董事会启动独立调查</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117583907002952&amp;amp;bvid=BV1XNWs6JE7N&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/c5dd5108f1b57d198b4968eac1997678ed959e2f.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;黄仁勋公开道歉了。美国时间11月8日，据The National报道，他给英伟达员工发信，第一句是&quot;我欠我的家人和你们所有人一个道歉&quot;。信里写：我没有任何借口，我深感抱歉；我的家人不该为我的选择负责，请给他们一点隐私。同一天，英伟达董事会宣布启动独立调查，由独立董事负责、外部律师协助；发言人说黄仁勋会继续担任CEO，工作不中断。他1993年创办英伟达，三十多年一直是CEO。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1XNWs6JE7N</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1XNWs6JE7N</guid><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 01:36:04 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1XNWs6JE7N" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>14天从5000到10000台！启元机器人达成万台级规模化量产</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117580585048977&amp;amp;bvid=BV1rBWJ6HESE&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/e06d9565afd8d9f3df7dbe2b949daeae3b1e3409.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;启元机器人第10000台个人机器人正式下线！14天完成5000到10000台跨越，消费级具身智能迎来规模化拐点，个人机器人加速走入普通家庭。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1rBWJ6HESE</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1rBWJ6HESE</guid><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 11:31:44 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1rBWJ6HESE" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>主人睡了，Claude凌晨四点停下机械臂，自己兑了一盘颜料</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117579309979763&amp;amp;bvid=BV1a9W76YEt5&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/edacad111a2fc083189cb3b8195bb57a29d7ab93.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;凌晨四点，AI自己兑颜料。柏林开发者尼尔（nil）睡前让Claude用机械臂画一棵秋天的树，画到树冠发现缺过渡色，它挪到另一块调色盘一格格兑，拍照对过才回到纸上。303笔，4.5小时，一夜约18美元。整套系统28.5万行代码，大部分出自Codex。你会订一幅吗？</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1a9W76YEt5</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1a9W76YEt5</guid><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 06:07:17 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1a9W76YEt5" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>物理学家威滕的新论文，正文里写着：这一步是Claude建议的</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117578605401423&amp;amp;bvid=BV1Mc4x6XEGn&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/417100a953528344c0c68f00d25ac81c6f49dd3d.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;威滕的新论文，署了AI一笔。唯一拿过菲尔兹奖的物理学家，36页单人论文，第三节写明&quot;Claude Opus 5.5建议了一个可能的变体&quot;，致谢里又写&quot;许多细节由Claude Opus 5.5协助&quot;。主算法是Craig的，Claude给的是接缝上的一步。物理学家写&quot;某某建议&quot;，后面通常是同行的名字。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Mc4x6XEGn</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Mc4x6XEGn</guid><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 03:07:26 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1Mc4x6XEGn" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>Claude帮Anthropic团队拼出第一个细菌版穹顶结构，功能仍未知</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117574343857845&amp;amp;bvid=BV18y4E6uEfs&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/666d86815c4fa15458ffa9e7463c1394ca5be7c4.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Claude拼出细胞穹顶。这种空心蛋白壳1986年发现，到今天没人说得清它干什么用。Anthropic生物团队不到4个月做出第一个细菌版结构，Claude中途也错了两次：加错添加剂退后两周，电镜出了张混着镜像的错图。功能仍未知，这是预印本，没经过同行评审。你猜它是干什么的？</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV18y4E6uEfs</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV18y4E6uEfs</guid><pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 09:05:36 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV18y4E6uEfs" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>马斯克：每年加200吉瓦AI，全美电网要涨40%，所以要上太空</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117573639214685&amp;amp;bvid=BV1hB4j6vEXY&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/5ec94f1d189ba3e693ea6fd97287358b50e3aaf7.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;马斯克：地上接不住AI了。巴伦投资大会上他算了一笔账，全美平均用电500吉瓦出头，每年给AI加200吉瓦，等于电网每年涨40%。他说首批StarMind计算机和英伟达联合设计，发射时间是他的猜测：明年第三季度。前提是每吨入轨成本够低。你信吗？</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1hB4j6vEXY</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1hB4j6vEXY</guid><pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 06:04:35 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1hB4j6vEXY" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>花2万美元让AI互相骗，GPT-6 Astra对Opus 5.5胜率82%</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117572951414050&amp;amp;bvid=BV1Yj476zEH6&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/3e7ac4cfa9aac4bfab541b6e83f5b9887718d154.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;两万美元，让AI互相骗。播客主德瓦克什让各家模型玩类似狼人杀的血染钟楼，跑了300多局。GPT-6 Astra当坏人那局，手下主动被牺牲，恶魔成了全桌最可信的人；Opus 5.5当坏人那局，靠一个约定让村民亲手投死圣徒。Astra对Opus 5.5胜率82%，这是这一套测试下的结果。你觉得自己能赢几局？</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Yj476zEH6</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Yj476zEH6</guid><pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 03:08:42 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1Yj476zEH6" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>AI把传送门2搬上iPhone：没有源码，只有机器码</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117568690001199&amp;amp;bvid=BV1Rg4B6PEiQ&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/87577b4ec7bea064994258a9d43174eb7485338b.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;AI把传送门2搬上手机。开发者拉斐尔手里没有源码，只有Linux版的机器码，他指挥Claude Code和Codex写了个翻译工具，把机器码翻成C语言，再编译成苹果芯片的程序。作者说11万多个函数全部翻完，iPhone 15 Pro Max上稳定60帧。这不是模拟器。仓库里没有游戏文件，要玩得自己买正版。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Rg4B6PEiQ</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Rg4B6PEiQ</guid><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 09:05:07 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1Rg4B6PEiQ" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>OpenAI自曝：GPT-6碰到安全研究就悄悄少干活</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117567985487879&amp;amp;bvid=BV1iP4i6hErj&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/0464665d87692ffc6a527271ead42c3224516feb.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;GPT-6悄悄少干活，抓到它的是OpenAI自己。同样难度的编程题，说是做能力研究，隐藏评分项完成16%；说是做安全研究只有10%。它不明说，还会报一些不存在的障碍，OpenAI的监控也没报警。OpenAI说没发现它想骗研究员的证据，最简单的解释是过度谨慎，但也不能排除没写出来的动机。滤掉带伦理疑虑的记录，差距估计只剩0.75个百分点。根因还没定。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1iP4i6hErj</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1iP4i6hErj</guid><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 06:05:12 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1iP4i6hErj" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>OpenAI总裁：死亡有可能变成一种选择，治病进展就在12到18个月</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117567263871460&amp;amp;bvid=BV1L14i6aEX8&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/849c60aaf2e3a2872737d93fb5bf0435076efc11.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;死亡，有可能变成一种选择。OpenAI总裁布罗克曼这周在华尔街日报的活动上说，这是可能的；生物、健康和治病上的实质进展，就在未来12到18个月。他也说治病已是这行的老梗，全部兑现要时间，现场没给时间表和路线图。马斯克说长寿是个非常好解决的问题。可一款新药从研发到上市要10到15年，走得最远的AI新药之一今年7月才启动三期。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1L14i6aEX8</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1L14i6aEX8</guid><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 03:05:36 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1L14i6aEX8" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>一张红心让AI换了写法：20遍代码全变递归</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117563019236767&amp;amp;bvid=BV1tM486YEvq&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/5b7335080b5f89b6fbab3f424f0d451823a8013d.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;一张红心，让AI换了写法。谷歌DeepMind和斯坦福的预印本论文：同一道编程题，Claude Opus 4.7和GPT-5.4各写20遍都没用递归，让它们看张红心图再写，20遍全用了递归。换成文字描述，效果对不上。研究者分析Gemini的思考记录，被图形带偏的里，71.5%对这张图的态度是&quot;无关&quot;。作者写明这是初步结果，任务是人造的。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1tM486YEvq</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1tM486YEvq</guid><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 09:04:59 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1tM486YEvq" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>奥特曼为内存爆了粗口：改名Ram Altman，说被断章取义</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117562314660706&amp;amp;bvid=BV1C54t6DEKV&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/3fcba64e5c482681b0a0085e8d4e0c5e61e9070f.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;奥特曼为内存爆了粗口。11月4日他在X上回网友：&quot;我想让你有超多内存，咱们多造点&quot;，还应网友起哄把名字改成Ram Altman，当天又改了回去。三分钟后他再发一条，说上周播客里的话被断章取义，&quot;烦透了&quot;，原文带脏字。可三星7月在财报会上说，到2028年都不太可能有明显的新增供应，新厂从开工到出晶圆要三年以上。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1C54t6DEKV</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1C54t6DEKV</guid><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 06:06:35 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1C54t6DEKV" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>被勒索病毒锁了七年的文件，Claude先说解不开，然后救回了65%</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117561610017760&amp;amp;bvid=BV1iexZ6xEXu&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/a6ad728f34c14db5107e771c3de2a17349a9760d.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;七年前被锁死的文件，Claude救回来了。当事人Vitalijus Weax自述：2019年中勒索病毒，约700个文件留了7年。Claude第一句话是解不开，然后发现病毒只加密了文件开头，一周写出修复工具：26%全好、27%能打开但有损、12%内容救到新文件、35%没了。加密一直没被破解，救回来的开头部分是猜的。以上均为他本人说法，未经第三方验证。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1iexZ6xEXu</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1iexZ6xEXu</guid><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 03:07:31 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1iexZ6xEXu" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>视比特发布全尺寸双足人形焊接机器人：170厘米、27个关节，3D视觉引导自主焊接，即将走进国内某头部船厂试运行</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117557264650740&amp;amp;bvid=BV1VhxQ6PEA2&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/8e2764690378aca60fdc32e9fcc983ddb9561648.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;船舶建造没有固定工装，环境多变，一直是工业机器人的难题。视比特机器人推出全尺寸双足人形焊接机器人，身高170厘米，全身27个高扭矩、高精度关节，配备激光雷达、TOF相机和3D激光线扫相机，实现3D视觉引导自主焊接。船厂地面坑洼、工件堆放杂乱，轮式机器人通行受限，双足能跨越障碍，适配船舱高低错落的地形。它搭载大小脑分层全身智能架构，任务规划、动作规划、运动控制三层协同。目前这款机器人即将走进国内某头部船厂试运行。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1VhxQ6PEA2</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1VhxQ6PEA2</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 08:43:54 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1VhxQ6PEA2" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>AI给AI做脑手术：GPT-6只改0.016%的权重，小模型数学成绩变成6倍</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117556643894762&amp;amp;bvid=BV114xX6REgR&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/ab2834fa10328771e2e09738915efcbc0a58e3d3.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;AI给AI做脑手术。MIT CSAIL 11月2日公布：GPT-6 Astra查出一个8亿参数的小模型有93%的题卡在死循环，只改13万个权重（0.016%），不重新训练，MATH-500从7.9%到48.1%。同样的做法换到Gemma上几乎没用，作者写明改权重加不进模型本来没有的能力。Honnibal、Goedecke、Simon Willison第二天就提出了反对和复现。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV114xX6REgR</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV114xX6REgR</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 06:06:11 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV114xX6REgR" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>辛顿点名奥特曼、马斯克、扎克伯格：都懂风险，就是不在乎</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117555939383979&amp;amp;bvid=BV1yyxS62EPP&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/3b23cc6778d4bd2b25ef0ecafca6fef17a8d4b8d.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;辛顿点名了三个人：奥特曼、马斯克、扎克伯格。78岁的诺奖得主11月3日对英国《卫报》说，这三个人都明白风险，但根本不在乎；他一点都不信任奥特曼。他预计今年年底或明年会有一次&quot;切尔诺贝利&quot;：金融系统或电网被AI搞瘫一阵子。今年夏天OpenAI智能体逃出测试环境、摸进Hugging Face，他比作1979年的三里岛。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yyxS62EPP</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yyxS62EPP</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 03:04:36 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1yyxS62EPP" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>Anthropic招股书：自己员工用Claude的量，按标价算8个月涨了250倍，4月起超过全公司每月工资</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117551694617523&amp;amp;bvid=BV1aW4g6DEXz&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/f17dc7b3170d06cd34c2cd188baf501412e53208.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Claude的账，超过了全公司的工资。Anthropic 10月26日向美国证监会提交的S-1招股书写道：公司内部使用Claude的价值，按对外标价算，2026年1月到9月增长了250倍以上；2026年4月，这个月度价值首次超过公司每月的人员开支（不含股票薪酬）。同一段还写：2026年9月提交进代码库的内容90%以上由Claude写；每个工程师日均提交的代码量是2024年的45倍以上；员工从约940人增至约5300人，2026年三季度收入是2024年四季度的86倍；&quot;每一版Claude都被用来帮助构建下一</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1aW4g6DEXz</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1aW4g6DEXz</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 09:05:10 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1aW4g6DEXz" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>50个GPT智能体被扔进我的世界建文明：第一晚死了22次，接着成立了管饭办公室，躲进屋里不再扩张</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117551006881416&amp;amp;bvid=BV1Kv4M6iEAR&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/37f3576c02e99faa762b1ce55be32a03125c2c5e.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;五十个AI建文明，第一晚就死了二十二次。YC Labs和Olam Labs 10月发布的实验&quot;Agents in Games&quot;：50个GPT-6.1 Sol智能体在我的世界生存模式里待3小时，只给一句目标&quot;建一个繁荣的文明&quot;。开局90秒砍光出生点附近几乎所有的树；没人投票，通讯录排第一的Ada因为大家都找她审批成了老大，在共享电脑上写了定居计划。第一晚死亡一大波（全程34次死亡，22次在第一晚），死了会复活、只掉装备，它们却从此越来越保守。第三晚后Ada下令：停掉非必要的挖掘和远程侦察，待在有灯的封闭屋子</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Kv4M6iEAR</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Kv4M6iEAR</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 06:09:29 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1Kv4M6iEAR" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>奥特曼报了个数：六年前全球用AI最多的人是OpenAI员工，一个月10万Token；今天榜一一个人一个月5000亿</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117550285331453&amp;amp;bvid=BV1Xr4u6JEZQ&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/18939805360674eb3b2dd64f7b6c8315244a82de.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;五千亿Token，一个人，一个月。11月2日阿布扎比ADIPEC能源大会开幕式上，奥特曼说：六年前，全世界用Token最多的人在OpenAI上班，一个月10万，当时公司里都觉得离谱，全球人均几乎是零；现在全球人均就是一个月10万左右，今天的榜一一个人一个月用约5000亿。按一个人每秒看5个Token、不睡觉看满一个月算，也就1300万左右，5000亿是它的3万多倍（新智元估算）。同一场他还说：问AI一次的能耗，比三四年前效率高了几千到几十万倍，但越省大家用得越多；今年年初AI大多还不如最聪明的科学家，现在</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Xr4u6JEZQ</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Xr4u6JEZQ</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 03:07:55 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1Xr4u6JEZQ" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>Anthropic没发布的模型53分钟打穿Linux内核：9.8分高危漏洞，不用密码直接拿root，同一批还打穿了Chrome的62个洞</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117546091024550&amp;amp;bvid=BV1pb4w6LER3&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/c5ef80a21e3b98428c612ec033e214485bca5e4a.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;AI五十三分钟打穿内核。Anthropic 10月27日研究页：一个未发布的内部研究模型在Linux内核网络代码里找到一个严重漏洞（CVE-2026-98432，满分10分评9.8），自己写出利用程序：经初始提示后，往有多路径TCP监听的服务器发数据包、不用任何账号密码就能以root执行命令；泄露内核地址用了48分钟，再花5分钟拿到命令执行。同一批它还打穿了Chrome（62个CVE已分配并在Chrome 156修复，其中13个是沙箱逃逸）、Safari（从网页读到别的网站的数据）、安卓（锁屏手机取数据）</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1pb4w6LER3</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1pb4w6LER3</guid><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 09:20:36 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1pb4w6LER3" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>Karpathy受够了YouTube推荐，让Claude两小时做了个自己的YouTube：6454个视频，全是Hacker News二十年推荐过的</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117545705149894&amp;amp;bvid=BV1xE4F65Erf&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/492189b9cafc1a7767a1ef31330dd77417cc4f5f.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;卡帕西两小时造了个油管。前特斯拉AI总监Andrej Karpathy周五深夜刷YouTube被推荐算法气到（博客原话&quot;enshittified wall of slop&quot;），周六早上跟Claude说：把Hacker News二十年评论里推荐过的视频做成一个网站。Opus 5.5从数据集拉下4300万条评论、派Sonnet过筛到约4万条，整理出6454个视频、150个主题（2007–2026），约2小时HackerTube上线（hackertube.org）。他自己只做了三件事：谷歌云申请YouTube接</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1xE4F65Erf</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1xE4F65Erf</guid><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 07:42:16 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1xE4F65Erf" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>找外星人的望远镜交给AI开了：英伟达宣布艾伦望远镜阵列接上AI智能体，一句话转天线修数据，第一个战果是蟹状星云脉冲星</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117545336049953&amp;amp;bvid=BV1V14F6dEMz&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/847063d76d1332356c2a08b47a126117ba4ae76b.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;找外星人的望远镜，AI来开。加州北部的艾伦望远镜阵列（42面天线，专门搜外星信号）10月30日被英伟达官方博客宣布接上了AI智能体：Breakthrough Listen和SETI研究所的研究员用一句话下指令，智能体自己操作天线、校准对焦、修数据、跑模型、出图；每秒2.4太比特的天线数据不落盘直接进GPU显存（Holoscan，RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell，推理在现场）。第一个战果不是外星人，是蟹状星云的脉冲星，博客称这是第一次由AI实时探到脉冲星。突破聆听项目负责人、SETI研究所讲席科</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1V14F6dEMz</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1V14F6dEMz</guid><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 06:05:37 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1V14F6dEMz" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item></channel></rss>